# Figma Mweb NP PLOT — UI law (non-negotiable)

**SoT frame:** `FINALL` (`46:9766`) — user handcrafted mweb NP PLOT.  
**Full forensic bible:** `design-system/mweb-np-plot-ui-learning.md`

When the user asks to replicate / extend **this** design language, **this rule wins** over older mobile NP PDP rules (`figma-np-pdp-mobile-ui`, prior 360 JMS frame).

## Before any build

1. Re-open / re-measure `46:9766` (or current selection if user says it superseded FINALL).  
2. Do **not** invent from the old AI `Mobile / NP PDP / JMS The Nation` frame.  
3. Bricks tokens + Iconography only — no custom SVGs / CDN icons.

## Anti-slop bans

- **No 360 width** — page is **412**.  
- **No section title 16px** — section H1 is **SemiBold 18**.  
- **No pad-all-16** on sections — use **`[20, 16, 20, 16]`**.  
- **No radius-24 on every section** — only first shelf top **`[24,24,0,0]`**; body sections **flat (0)**.  
- **No black Zero brokerage** — soft `surface/default` + Regular 12 `text/secondary`, radius **8**.  
- **No inventing circles** for Back/Share/Save — **40×40**, `radius/m`, stroke **`border/subtle` 1.5**.  
- **No invented icons** — closest Bricks Iconography match only.  
- **No raw stage-list as Payment plan primary** — EMI summary + CTA per SoT.  
- **No web-1512 recipes** on this surface.

